WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.433 line:-3
Now I switch Combo Ski to snowshoe mode.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.433 line:-3
I press the button,

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.100 line:-3
and release the rear slot.

4
00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:08.333 line:-3
and do the same on the other side.

5
00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:13.200 line:-3
And now, as I mentioned earlier,

6
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:14.733 line:-3
the most important thing is,

7
00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:17.033 line:-3
that the metal spikes are at the front.

8
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.000 line:-3
So I attach only the middle pin

9
00:00:23.566 --> 00:00:27.400 line:-3
and press it in. If there is snow
inside, I simply blow it out,

10
00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:29.933 line:-3
and do the same on the other side.

11
00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:33.333 line:-3
This is how snowshoe mode
is set. As you can see,

12
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.166 line:-3
I am now inserting my right foot.

13
00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.933 line:-3
I slide my foot fully back and check

14
00:00:44.966 --> 00:00:47.333 line:-3
that the textile heel
strap is seated securely.

15
00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:52.633 line:-3
I tighten the front strap over the toes,

16
00:00:55.766 --> 00:00:58.016 line:-3
then the rear strap over the top of the foot,

17
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.333 line:-3
and finally the upper Velcro strap.

18
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.600 line:-3
As you can see, the toe of the boot
is aligned with the tip of Combo Ski.

19
00:01:10.933 --> 00:01:12.983 line:-3
This means Combo Ski is correctly fitted.

20
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.033 line:-3
I can comfortably walk uphill.

21
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:22.933 line:-3
On very steep terrain,

22
00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:25.400 line:-3
don’t hesitate to dig
Combo Ski into the snow.
